      "IWDT": "Own IWDT uses dedicated RC10K, not LSI; do not require IWDT.RUN=0 to establish LSI idleness.",
      "ADC": "ADC clock is PCLK divided by 1..128; no LSI selector. SYSCLK!=LSI removes the indirect dependency.",
